{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-Apocalyptic Wasteland: Escape Guide (Death Included with Free Shipping)\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision kills, slick moves\u2014don't die like an idiot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/5bcea1388f4ba2d8e78e8ab7681076dc.poster.avif?t=1774606296\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/5bcea1388f4ba2d8e78e8ab7681076dc.webm?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/5bcea1388f4ba2d8e78e8ab7681076dc.mp4?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you can't win a fight, throw rocks, sneak up from behind, or maybe chant a spell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b227a194cd0a3e28dd9a74d6c1e90c1a.poster.avif?t=1774606296\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b227a194cd0a3e28dd9a74d6c1e90c1a.webm?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b227a194cd0a3e28dd9a74d6c1e90c1a.mp4?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack your way from one station to the next, grabbing gas, canned food, and those shiny zombie crystals along the way (rumored to trade for gear, or maybe just a pile of junk).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b51d736fd0541193e8bd3a9c3afe7a37.poster.avif?t=1774606296\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b51d736fd0541193e8bd3a9c3afe7a37.webm?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/b51d736fd0541193e8bd3a9c3afe7a37.mp4?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your backpack\u2019s limited\u2014bring a razor-sharp blade or a nuisance-level megaphone? Butcher knives, forks, steroids, running shoes, jet boosters, quantum blades, fireworks, soul-binding charms, undead convoys, rubber chickens... The crazier the combo, the higher your odds of survival (or the opposite).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/6380bb9fe482f2bb78384c96188537df.avif?t=1774606296\" width=780 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each station offers something different:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abandoned Block:</strong>\u200b Nothing unexpected here... probably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demon Block:</strong>\u200b The zombies there are a bit crazy, but they drop extra loot. A tough call, really.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Derelict Gas Station:</strong>\u200b Gather more fuel here to cut travel time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Abandoned Supermarket:</strong>\u200b Plenty of food to last a few more days\u2014or trade for cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shop:</strong>\u200b Might just find that treasure you've been eyeing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hospital:</strong>\u200b Can the doctor give us a discount...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synth Factory:</strong>\u200b Out of options? Surrender to fate or seize a desperate chance. You've got nothing left to lose.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/ba2b6b830f8e428b5e209b112aa32d58.poster.avif?t=1774606296\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/ba2b6b830f8e428b5e209b112aa32d58.webm?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/ba2b6b830f8e428b5e209b112aa32d58.mp4?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map sprawls like a spiderweb, with demon districts beckoning. Which path to take? Pick the maddest one\u2014since no route guarantees a long life, might as well die with flair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/8b16098c58409f1841c1326be7291a2f.poster.avif?t=1774606296\" width=780 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/8b16098c58409f1841c1326be7291a2f.webm?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3970080/extras/8b16098c58409f1841c1326be7291a2f.mp4?t=1774606296\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let\u2019s go\u2014make those zombies regret crawling out of their graves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3970080?t=1774606296","background_raw":"ht